# Hexana CLI @VERSION@

This directory contains the native Hexana command-line products for the
supported release platforms.

Choose `hexana-cli` for `summarize-binary`, `summarize-module`, and
`wasm-to-wat`. Choose `hexana-cli-script` for `run-script`. Both products also
provide `tools`, `version`, and `help`.

## Downloads

| Product | macOS Apple silicon | Linux x86-64 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `hexana-cli` | [Download](@DOWNLOADS_PREFIX@/hexana-cli-native-macos-arm64-@VERSION@.zip) | [Download](@DOWNLOADS_PREFIX@/hexana-cli-native-linux-x64-@VERSION@.zip) |
| `hexana-cli-script` | [Download](@DOWNLOADS_PREFIX@/hexana-cli-script-native-macos-arm64-@VERSION@.zip) | [Download](@DOWNLOADS_PREFIX@/hexana-cli-script-native-linux-x64-@VERSION@.zip) |

Each ZIP has a sibling `.sha256` file. Verify it before extracting:

```bash
shasum -a 256 -c hexana-cli-native-macos-arm64-@VERSION@.zip.sha256
unzip hexana-cli-native-macos-arm64-@VERSION@.zip
./bin/hexana-cli version
```

On Linux, use `sha256sum -c`. Every archive contains `LICENSE.txt` and
`THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md`. Machine-readable metadata is available in
[`hexana-cli-release-@VERSION@.json`](@DOWNLOADS_PREFIX@/hexana-cli-release-@VERSION@.json).
